@startuml Sequence Diagram - Network Error
title Escenario 3 - Error de Red (Simulator API)
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam titleFontSize 11
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 10
skinparam ActorFontSize 10
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam NoteFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 10
skinparam SequenceDividerFontSize 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #666666
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #666666

participant "Comercio\n(Backend)" as Comercio
participant "SDK KitPagos" as SDK
participant "Simulator API\n(Fastify)" as SimAPI
participant "Scenario Engine" as Engine

Comercio -> SDK : createPayment(\nCreatePaymentRequest)
SDK -> SimAPI : POST /v1/sim/{gateway}/payments\n(Header x-simulator-scenario:\nSLOW, NETWORK_ERROR o SERVER_ERROR)
SimAPI -> Engine : resolveScenario(\nheaders, body) ->\nescenario

alt SLOW o NETWORK_ERROR
  Engine -->x SDK : SLOW: sin respuesta antes\ndel plazo; NETWORK_ERROR:\ncorta la conexion
  SDK -->x SDK : AbortError / socket hang up
  SDK -> SDK : mapear a KitPagosError(\nGATEWAY_TIMEOUT\no CONNECTION_FAILED)
else SERVER_ERROR
  Engine --> SimAPI : HTTP 500, 502 o 503\n(igual en las\ncuatro pasarelas)
  SimAPI --> SDK : cuerpo de error nativo
  SDK -> SDK : ErrorHandler: 5xx ->\nGATEWAY_SERVER_ERROR
end

SDK -->x Comercio : throw KitPagosError{\ncode, gateway,\noriginalPayload}

note bottom
  Las dos ramas dan errores RETRIABLE, pero createPayment() no se
  reintenta (ADR-05). Las cuatro pasarelas usan el status HTTP: Kushki
  responde 400 al rechazo del procesador (017 a 023 en
  details.responseCode) y a K001, K004 o K220; su adaptador lee el
  cuerpo para separar el rechazo. Rapyd deja el detalle en
  body.status.error_code.
end note

@enduml
